{
  "dom_id": "step-143141",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Solving Absolute Value Equations With Negative Variable Coefficients",
  "problem": "Solve the equation $|5-8y| = 11.$",
  "worked_solution": "Either the positive or negative of the expression inside the absolute value must be equal to the right-hand side of the equation.\n\nSo, we set up the two corresponding equations and solve them independently:\n\n- If $|5-8y| = 5-8y,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|5-8y| & =11 \\\\ 5-8y & =11 \\\\ -8y & =6 \\\\ \\frac{-8y}{-8} & =\\frac{6}{-8} \\\\ y & =-\\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $|5-8y| = -(5-8y),$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|5-8y| & =11 \\\\ -(5-8y) & =11 \\\\ -5+8y & =11 \\\\ 8y & =16 \\\\ \\frac{8y}{8} & =\\frac{16}{8} \\\\ y & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $y=-\\dfrac34$ and $y=2.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-143141\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"143141\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"14225\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-143141\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-10\">Solving Absolute Value Equations With Negative Variable Coefficients</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"143141\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            marg